tinacloud-project-update(1) -- Update TinaCloud project settings
===============================================================

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud project update` <command>

## DESCRIPTION

Update site URLs and protected branches for a TinaCloud project. Commands use
the current project's `tina/tinacloud.json` unless both organisation and
project IDs are supplied.

## COMMANDS

  * `site-url`:
    Add or remove site URLs.

  * `protected-branch`:
    Add or remove protected branches for projects with editorial workflow.

## EXAMPLES

Add a production site URL to the configured project:

	$ tinacloud project update site-url add --url https://example.com

Add a protected branch with explicit project IDs:

	$ tinacloud project update protected-branch add \
		--org-id <organization-id> \
		--project-id <project-id> \
		--branch main

